cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use StericX, please cite this software. StericX is an independent
  reproduction and reimplementation; if you use the underlying descriptors,
  datasets, or reaction models, please also cite the original scientific
  works listed under `references` below.
title: "StericX: physical-organic molecular featurization and reaction-selectivity inference"
type: software
authors:
